The ''Engishiki'' counts 34 {{ill|Shikinaisha|WD=Q134917286}} in the province – 33 {{ill|Shikinai Shosha|WD=Q134917287}} and 1 {{ill|Shikinai Taisha|WD=Q134917288}}.
